    {
      "id": "claim_a5f2c5a28945480a833aef1f9106ace4",
      "statement": "A cold takeover gates on the prior owner's log state: an absent or sealed record means the bucket is complete, while an open or recovering record forces recovery first — CAS-fence the record, seal reachable followers, upload their retained segments and bundles into per-cell prefixes, then mark sealed — before any restore.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://crates/logic/log_tier.rs#L208-L220",
